<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's NTMA says tap in 10-year bond closed.</title>
<headline>Ireland's NTMA says tap in 10-year bond closed.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Wednesday that a 75 million punt tap issue in the eight percent bond due 2006 was closed.</p>
<p>The NTMA said all the stock was sold.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
